PLACEHOLDER — not a real PNG image.

The Grad-CAM explanation overlay is generated at runtime, not shipped as a
static asset. See:
  lib/presentation/widgets/result/gradcam_overlay.dart

Behaviour:
- If a TriageResult carries a heatmapPath pointing to an existing file, that
  heatmap is blended over the captured photo at 50% opacity.
- Otherwise (the current placeholder model produces no heatmap), the overlay
  shows the message: "Explanation unavailable for placeholder model".

When on-device Grad-CAM is implemented, the generated heatmap image will be
written to the app's documents directory and referenced via heatmapPath — no
bundled placeholder image is required.
